%% Surface lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    state Surface {
        [*] --> Created
        Created --> PendingAttach: attach(buffer)
        PendingAttach --> PendingCommit: commit
        PendingCommit --> Mapped: role + first commit
        Mapped --> Damaged: attach + damage
        Damaged --> PendingCommit
        Mapped --> Unmapped: unmap
        Unmapped --> Mapped: recommit
        Unmapped --> Destroyed
        Created --> Destroyed
        Mapped --> Destroyed
        Destroyed --> [*]
    }

---
%% Seat / focus lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    state Seat {
        [*] --> Idle
        Idle --> PointerFocus: enter(surface)
        PointerFocus --> Idle: leave
        Idle --> KeyboardFocus: focus(surface)
        KeyboardFocus --> Idle: unfocus
        PointerFocus --> CompositorGrab: shell move/resize
        CompositorGrab --> PointerFocus: release
    }

---
%% Widget lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    state Widget {
        [*] --> Detached
        Detached --> Attached: mount()
        Attached --> Styled: theme resolved
        Styled --> LaidOut: layout pass
        LaidOut --> Visible
        Visible --> Dirty: property change
        Dirty --> LaidOut
        Attached --> Destroyed
        Destroyed --> [*]
    }

---
%% zlm_toplevel_v1 (compositor-owned)
stateDiagram-v2
    state ZlmToplevel {
        [*] --> Created: xdg_toplevel mapped
        Created --> Active: snapshot/delta to shell
        Active --> Active: state/geometry updates
        Active --> Destroyed: unmap
        Destroyed --> [*]
    }
